<h4>Non-Functional Requirements</h4>
<ul><li><strong>Low Transmission Latency:</strong> WebRTC peer connection audio-video round-trip delay is maintained below 150ms under standard broadband conditions; translation responses resolve in under 200ms.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>High Availability &amp; Fault Tolerance:</strong> Multi-tier translation ensures that if primary Google translation fails, GTX, MyMemory, and the local clinical lexicon serve as instant fallbacks.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Security &amp; Confidentiality:</strong> Passwords hashed with bcrypt (salt factor 10); REST endpoints protected by JWT bearer authentication; WebRTC media streams encrypted via DTLS/SRTP.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Usability &amp; Ergonomics:</strong> High-contrast healthcare color palette; responsive layout supporting desktop monitors, tablets, and mobile smartphones; prominent audio unblock banners for mobile browser autoplay policies.</li></ul>
