<h3>3.2 System Architecture</h3>
<p>MEDIBRIDGE utilizes a decoupled, modern three-tier client-server architecture supplemented by a peer-to-peer real-time communication mesh and an intelligent multi-tier translation pipeline. Figure 3.1 illustrates the structural flow of data across the client, backend, database, and real-time signalling layers.</p>
<pre><code>+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                    FIGURE 3.1: SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                                                    |
|   +--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+   |
|   |                              PRESENTATION LAYER (REACT 18 + VITE)                          |   |
|   |   +-------------------+  +--------------------+  +--------------------+  +-------------+   |   |
|   |   |  Patient Portal   |  |   Doctor Portal    |  | Interpreter Portal |  | Admin Portal|   |   |
|   |   +---------+---------+  +---------+----------+  +---------+----------+  +------+------+   |   |
|   |             |                      |                       |                    |          |   |
|   |             +----------------------+-----------------------+--------------------+          |   |
|   |                                    |                                                       |   |
|   |                    +---------------+---------------+                                       |   |
|   |                    | WebRTC Hook (useWebRTC.js)   |                                       |   |
|   |                    | * getUserMedia Local Stream   |                                       |   |
|   |                    | * RTCPeerConnection Mesh      |                                       |   |
|   |                    | * Remote Stream Manager       |                                       |   |
|   |                    +---------------+---------------+                                       |   |
|   |                                    |                                                       |   |
|   +------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------+   |
|                                        |                                                           |
|             +--------------------------+--------------------------+                                |
|             | (P2P Audio/Video Streams via DTLS/SRTP)            | (Signalling &amp; REST Requests)   |
|             v                                                     v                                |
|   +--------------------+                               +---------------------------------------+   |
|   |   REMOTE PEERS     |                               |      NODE.JS / EXPRESS BACKEND        |   |
|   |  (Doctor / Patient |                               |  * Port 5000 API Engine               |   |
|   |   / Interpreter)   |                               |  * DualProxy Port 5173 (Auto HTTPS)   |   |
|   +--------------------+                               +-------------------+-------------------+   |
|                                                                            |                       |
|                                      +-------------------------------------+--------------------+  |
|                                      |                                                          |  |
|                                      v                                                          v  |
|                   +------------------------------------+             +-----------------------------+
|                   |       SOCKET.IO SIGNALLING HUB     |             |      REST CONTROLLERS       |
|                   |  * room_joined / existing_peers    |             |  * Auth (JWT, Bcrypt)       |
|                   |  * offer / answer / ice_candidate  |             |  * Appointments &amp; Conflict  |
|                   |  * speech_transcript sync          |             |  * Doctor Discovery         |
|                   |  * dispatch_interpreter_request    |             |  * Digital Prescriptions    |
|                   +------------------------------------+             +--------------+--------------+
|                                                                                     |              |
|                                      +----------------------------------------------+              |
|                                      |                                                             |
|                                      v                                                             v
|                   +------------------------------------+             +-----------------------------+
|                   |   MULTI-TIER TRANSLATION SERVICE   |             |     MONGODB DATABASE        |
|                   |  * Tier 1: Google Clients5 (&lt;150ms)|             |  * users                    |
|                   |  * Tier 2: Google GTX Engine       |             |  * doctorprofiles           |
|                   |  * Tier 3: MyMemory Translation    |             |  * appointments             |
|                   |  * Tier 4: Clinical Lexicon        |             |  * consultations            |
|                   |  * Polish: Honorific Refinement    |             |  * prescriptions            |
|                   +------------------------------------+             +-----------------------------+
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+</code></pre>
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h3>Table 3.4 Architectural Layers and Operational Responsibilities</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Layer Name</th>
    <th>Subsystems &amp; Directories</th>
    <th>Operational Responsibilities</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Presentation Layer</strong></td>
    <td><code>frontend/src/pages/</code>, <code>components/</code></td>
    <td>Responsive UI rendering, form handling, video viewports, Language Bridge</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>State &amp; Hooks Layer</strong></td>
    <td><code>contexts/</code>, <code>hooks/useWebRTC.js</code></td>
    <td>User authentication state, WebRTC media acquisition, socket subscriptions</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Signalling Layer</strong></td>
    <td><code>backend/services/socketService.js</code></td>
    <td>Multi-peer mesh coordination, SDP offer/answer exchange, ICE routing</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Application Layer</strong></td>
    <td><code>backend/controllers/</code>, <code>routes/</code></td>
    <td>Business rules, slot conflict checking, prescription creation, auth tokens</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Intelligence Layer</strong></td>
    <td><code>backend/services/translationService.js</code></td>
    <td>Clinical lexicon lookups, multi-tier machine translation, honorifics</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Data Persistence</strong></td>
    <td>MongoDB Database &amp; Mongoose ODM</td>
    <td>ACID-compliant storage of users, doctors, appointments, prescriptions</td>
  </tr>
</table>

