                 |     PATIENT (USER)       |
                 +-------------+------------+
                               |
               Credentials,    |   Appointment Request,
               Symptoms        |   Spoken Tamil Voice
                               v
            +------------------+-------------------+
            |  1.0 Authentication &amp; Portal Router  | &lt;-----&gt; [ D1: Users &amp; Auth Records ]
            +------------------+-------------------+
                               |
               User Profile &amp;  |   Verified Credentials
               Role State      v
            +------------------+-------------------+
