<h1>CHAPTER 5</h1>
<h1>RESULTS AND TESTING</h1>
<h3>5.1 System Walkthrough and Screen Interfaces</h3>
<p>The running application was comprehensively evaluated across mobile smartphones (Android Chrome), laptop browsers (Windows/macOS Chrome, Edge), and tablets.</p>
<ul><li><strong>Figure 5.1 – Landing Page &amp; Doctor Discovery Portal:</strong> Shows the public portal, language switcher in 6 regional languages, emergency disclaimer banner, and doctor search bar with speciality filters.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Figure 5.2 – Patient Appointment Booking &amp; Conflict Check:</strong> Shows the interactive slot picker with real-time status. When a slot is already reserved, the backend rejects double-booking attempts and shows an alert.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Figure 5.3 – Doctor Dashboard &amp; Real-Time Booking Synchronizer:</strong> Displays daily appointment queues. When a patient books an appointment, Socket.IO emits <code>new_appointment</code>, instantly adding it to the doctor's queue with zero delay.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Figure 5.4 – Consultation Room with WebRTC Video &amp; Live Subtitles:</strong> Displays the active consultation room. Doctor and patient video streams render side by side. When the patient speaks Tamil, speech recognition captures the audio, translates it, and displays English subtitles on the doctor's screen in real time.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Figure 5.5 – Language Bridge &amp; Quick Phrases Carousel:</strong> Displays the in-call side panel. Doctors can select categorized Quick Phrases (e.g., <em>"Are you ok?"</em>, <em>"Where does it hurt?"</em>), which are automatically sent and translated into polite Tamil (<em>"நீங்கள் நலமா?"</em>).</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Figure 5.6 – On-Demand Interpreter Dispatch:</strong> Shows an active consultation room where a certified medical interpreter has accepted a dispatch alert and joined the call as a third WebRTC peer.</li></ul>
<ul><li><strong>Figure 5.7 – Digital Prescription Generation &amp; Medical Record:</strong> Shows the doctor authoring a structured digital prescription with dosage frequency, duration, dietary advice, and follow-up date, available for instant patient download.</li></ul>
<div class="page-break"></div>
